{
  "_note": "Everything LYNXgwas needs besides its own code. 'setup' downloads and prepares the missing items, 'check' reports what each analysis lacks. Paths are relative to the app folder. GRCh37 is the default build; GRCh38 items are needed only for GRCh38 projects.",
